RX EXEC : 20260312 20:22:42 
Cross_Ref for: INF EXEC * 
 
 
Source statements: 
00001 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00002 | Function : Display a menu of MDISK, Virtual DASD & filepool    |                                                   
00003 |            directories                                         |                                                   
00004 |                                                                |                                                   
00005 | File     : MD       EXEC                                       |                                                   
00006 +----------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00007 | Version  : 1.1.0                                               |                                                   
00008 |                                                                |                                                   
00009 | Files    : VMLINK   EXEC                                       |                                                   
00010 |            FILELIST EXEC                                       |                                                   
00011 |            cms ACCESS  cmd                                     |                                                   
00012 |            cms RELEASE cmd                                     |                                                   
00013 |            cms HELP    cmd                                     |                                                   
00014 |            cp  DETACH  cmd                                     |                                                   
00015 |                                                                |                                                   
00016 | Called   : MD       .                                          |                                                   
00017 |                                                                |                                                   
00018 | Comments : .                                                   |                                                   
00019 |                                                                |                                                   
00020 | Author   : H.T.Kramer, ,                                       |                                                   
00021 | Created  : 20200513 07:42:03                                   |                                                   
00022 | Changes  : .                                                   |                                                   
00023 |            20260207 H.T.Kramer : Added percentage 4 sfs dirs   |                                                   
00024 |            20250526 H.T.Kramer : Fixed problem with accessing  |                                                   
00025 |                                  filepool directory            |                                                   
00026 |            20250526 H.T.Kramer : Added no of blocks for        |                                                   
00027 |                                  filepool directories.         |                                                   
00028 |                                  Add owner for fp directories. |                                                   
00029 |            20200514 H.T.Kramer : Fixed some typos and minor    |                                                   
00030 |                            errors                              |                                                   
00031 |                                                                |                                                   
00032 |                                                                |                                                   
00033 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00034 Parse Upper Arg what .                                                                                               
00035 Parse Source . . myfn myft .                                                                                         
00036 If what='?' Then Do                                                                                                  
00037                  'VMFCLEAR'                                                                                          
00038                  'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00038 END ?)',                                                                  
00039                                     '< 'myfn' EXEC *',                                                               
00040                                     '| tolabel Parse',                                                               
00041                                     '| cons'                                                                         
00042                  Call Exit                                                                                           
00043                  End                                                                                                 
00044 If what<>'' Then Call Exit                                                                                           
00045 Select                                                                                                               
00046 When myft='EXEC'  Then Call RunExec                                                                                  
00047 When myft='XEDIT' Then Call RunXedit                                                                                 
00048 Otherwise Call Exit 99                                                                                               
00049 End                                                                                                                  
00050                                                                                                                      
00051                                                                                                                      
00052 Exit:                                                                                                                
00053 Parse Upper Arg exrc .                                                                                               
00054 If exrc='' | exrc='EXRC' Then exrc=0                                                                                 
00055 Exit exrc                                                                                                            
00056                                                                                                                      
00057                                                                                                                      
00058 RunXedit:                                                                                                            
00059 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00060 | The xedit part of the code                                     |                                                   
00061 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00062 Call XeditSettings                                                                                                   
00063 Call SetHeader                                                                                                       
00064 pfk='1=Help, 2=, 3=Quit, 4=Release, 5=, 6=Detach, 7=, 8=, 9=Link, 10=Access, 11=Filelist, 12=Quit'                   
00065 Call SetPFKeys                                                                                                       
00066 Call Collect_Info                                                                                                    
00067 Call Display                                                                                                         
00068 Do x=1                                                                                                               
00069   'READ ALL NUMBER'                             /* Get from XEDIT   */                                               
00070   'EXTRACT /CURSOR'                             /* Where is cursor  */                                               
00071   sel=cursor.1                                  /* This is selctd   */                                               
00072   lineno=sel-firstline                          /* Which rsrvd line */                                               
00073   wfm=Substr(input.lineno,14,1)                 /* Take this        */                                               
00074   cuu=Substr(input.lineno,8,4)                  /* ...& this        */                                               
00075   dir=Substr(input.lineno,105)                  /* ....& this       */                                               
00076   If cuu='FILC' | cuu='DIRC' Then dirhandle=1    /* Is it a DIR?     */                                              
00077                              Else dirhandle=0    /* .                */                                              
00078   refresh=0                                     /* Initialise this  */                                               
00079  Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00079 END ?)',                                                                      
00080      'stack',                                   /* Read from stack  */                                               
00081      '| xlate upper',                           /* Uppercase        */                                               
00082      '| strip',                                 /* Remove spaces    */                                               
00083      '| join * x40',                            /* Make 1 rec       */                                               
00084      '| f: fanout',                             /* Duplicate rec    */                                               
00085      '| specs w1.1',                            /* Keep this        */                                               
00086      '| var cmd',                               /* Store as         */                                               
00087      '? f:',                                    /* Conn 2 fanout    */                                               
00088      '| specs w2;*',                            /* Keep this        */                                               
00089      '| strip ~_~',                             /* Remove these     */                                               
00090      '| var parms'                              /* Store as         */                                               
00091 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00092 | S & Y are skipped because changing them breaks CMS for you     |                                                   
00093 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00094   usablemodes='ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRTUVWXZ'                                                                             
00095   If (Length(cmd)=1 &,                                                                                               
00096      Pos(cmd,usablemodes)<>0) |,                                                                                     
00097      (Length(cmd)=1 &,                                                                                               
00098      cmd='.') |,                                                                                                     
00099      (Length(cmd)=3  &,                                                                                              
00100      Pos('/',cmd)=2 &,                                                                                               
00101      Pos(Substr(cmd,1,1),usablemodes)<>0 &,                                                                          
00102      Pos(Substr(cmd,3,1),usablemodes)<>0) Then Do                                                                    
00103                                                wfm=cmd                                                               
00104                                                cmd='ACCESSWM'                                                        
00105  Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00105 END ?)',                                                                      
00106                                                   'cms RELEASE 'cuu,                                                 
00107                                                   '| hole'                                                           
00108                                                End                                                                   
00109 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00110 | What to do when we hit these commands                          |                                                   
00111 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00112   Select                                                                                                             
00113   When cmd='ENTER'    Then refresh=1                                                                                 
00114   When cmd='FILELIST' Then Do                                                                                        
00115                            If wfm='.' Then Do                                                                        
00116                                       If dirhandle then targ='.DIR 'dir                                              
00117                                                    Else targ=' * 'cuu                                                
00118                                       Address CMS 'VMLINK 'targ' (NONAMES QUIET FILELIST'                            
00119                                       End                                                                            
00120                                       Else Do                                                                        
00121                                       If dirhandle Then targ=dir                                                     
00122                                                    Else targ=wfm                                                     
00123                                       Address CMS 'FILELIST * * 'targ                                                
00124                                       End                                                                            
00125                            End                                                                                       
00126   When cmd='DETACH'   Then Do                                                                                        
00127  If \dirhandle Then Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00127 END ?)',                                                   
00128                                                              'cp DETACH 'cuu,                                        
00129                                                              '| HOLE'                                                
00130                                          Else 'EMSG Can not DETACH directory: 'Strip(dir)                            
00131                            refresh=1                                                                                 
00132                            End                                                                                       
00133   When cmd='RELEASE'  Then Do                                                                                        
00134                            If wfm<>'.' Then Address CMS 'RELEASE 'wfm                                                
00135                                        Else 'EMSG Can not RELEASE 'wfm' item is not ACCESSed'                        
00136                            refresh=1                                                                                 
00137                            End                                                                                       
00138   When cmd='ACCESS'   Then Do                                                                                        
00139                            'GETFMADR'                                                                                
00140                            Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00140 END ?)',                                            
00141                                           'stack',                                                                   
00142                                           '| specs w2.1',                                                            
00143                                           '| var wfm'                                                                
00144                            If dirhandle Then what=dir                                                                
00145                                         Else what=cuu                                                                
00146                            Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00146 END ?)',                                            
00147                                           'CMS ACCESS 'what wfm,                                                     
00148                                           '| hole'                                                                   
00149                            refresh=1                                                                                 
00150                            End                                                                                       
00151   When cmd='ACCESSWM' Then Do                                                                                        
00152                            If dirhandle Then what=dir                                                                
00153                                        Else what=cuu                                                                 
00154                            Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00154 END ?)',                                            
00155                                           'CMS ACCESS 'what wfm,                                                     
00156                                           '| hole'                                                                   
00157                            refresh=1                                                                                 
00158                            End                                                                                       
00159   When cmd='LINK'     Then Do                                                                                        
00160                            If Pos(':',parms)<>0 Then parms='.DIR 'parms                                              
00161                            Address CMS 'VMLINK 'parms' (NONAMES QUIET'                                               
00162                            refresh=1                                                                                 
00163                            End                                                                                       
00164   When cmd='HELP'     Then Address CMS 'HELP 'myfn                                                                   
00165   When cmd='QUIT'     Then Do                                                                                        
00166                            Queue 'QQUIT'                                                                             
00167                            Leave x                                                                                   
00168                            End                                                                                       
00169   Otherwise Nop                                                                                                      
00170   End                                                                                                                
00171   If refresh Then Do                                                                                                 
00172                   Call Collect_Info                                                                                  
00173                   Call Display                                                                                       
00174                   End                                                                                                
00175 End x                                                                                                                
00176 Return                                                                                                               
00177                                                                                                                      
00178                                                                                                                      
00179 Display:                                                                                                             
00180 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00181 | Set up the display                                             |                                                   
00182 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00183 'SET RESERVED 3 WHITE NON NOH 'inf                                                                                   
00184 'SET RESERVED 4 WHITE NON NOH 'hdr                                                                                   
00185 'SET RESERVED 5 WHITE NON NOH 'seprtr                                                                                
00186 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00187 | Set up the filled lines                                        |                                                   
00188 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00189 Do i=1 To input.0                                                                                                    
00190     'SET RESERVED 'firstline+i' YELLOW NON NOH 'input.i                                                              
00191 End i                                                                                                                
00192 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00193 | Clear the rest of the lines                                    |                                                   
00194 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00195 Do m=firstline+input.0+1 To maxlines                                                                                 
00196     'SET RESERVED 'm' YELLOW NON NOH '                                                                               
00197 End m                                                                                                                
00198 'SET RESERVED 'lastline' WHITE NON NOH 'pfk                                                                          
00199 Return                                                                                                               
00200                                                                                                                      
00201                                                                                                                      
00202 Collect_Info:                                                                                                        
00203 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00204 | Collect the info                                               |                                                   
00205 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00206 Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00206 END ?)',                                                                       
00207    'cms QUERY DISK',                            /* Ask cms          */                                               
00208    '| drop first 1',                            /* Drop header      */                                               
00209    '| p: pick substr 1.3 of w2.1 \== ~DIR~',    /* Select these     */                                               
00210    '| specs pad 0 w1.1 1',                      /* Adjus cuu        */                                               
00211    '              w2.1 nw.4 right',             /* .                */                                               
00212    '              w3;* nw',                     /* .                */                                               
00213    '| specs w2.1 1',                            /* Prefix w cuu     */                                               
00214    '        ~1~ nw',                            /* .                */                                               
00215    '        w1;* nw ',                          /* .                */                                               
00216    '        ~;~n',                              /* .                */                                               
00217    '| fi1: faninany',                           /* Take in other    */                                               
00218    '| sort w1.2',                               /* Sort...          */                                               
00219    '| join keylen 4',                           /* Join recs        */                                               
00220    '| specs w2;*',                              /* Keep this        */                                               
00221    '| if2: if pick w1.1 \== ~1~',               /* If we do not     */                                               
00222    '|   specs ~1 . ~ 1',                        /* .have this info  */                                               
00223    '          w2.1 nw',                         /* ...we adjust     */                                               
00224    '          ~. . . . . . . . .;~ nw ',        /* .... the record  */                                               
00225    '          w1;* nw',                         /* .                */                                               
00226    '| if2:',                                    /* Conn 2 if        */                                               
00227    '| specs w4.1 1.4 w2;* nw',                  /* Adjust record    */                                               
00228    '| fi3: faninany',                           /* Take in others   */                                               
00229    '| sort 1.3',                                /* Sort on filemode */                                               
00230    '| change ~ FB ~ >>> ~',                     /* Replace this     */                                               
00231    '| change w8.1 ~4096~4K~',                   /* Replace these    */                                               
00232    '| change w8.1 ~2048~2K~',                   /* .                */                                               
00233    '| change w8.1 ~1024~1K~',                   /* .                */                                               
00234    '| specs w2.1 1.6',                          /* Rework layout    */                                               
00235    '        w3.1 nw.4',                         /* .                */                                               
00236    '        ~%g~ n',                            /* .                */                                               
00237    '        w4.1 n.4',                          /* .                */                                               
00238    '        ~%Y~ n',                            /* .                */                                               
00239    '        w5.1 n.3',                          /* .                */                                               
00240    '        w6.1 nw.6 right',                   /* .                */                                               
00241    '        w8.1 nw.3 right',                   /* .                */                                               
00242    '        w9.1 nw.5 right',                   /* .                */                                               
00243    '        w10.1 nw.13 right',                 /* .                */                                               
00244    '        w11.1 nw.10 right',                 /* .                */                                               
00245    '        w12.1 nw.10 right',                 /* .                */                                               
00246    '        w15.1 nw.4 right',                  /* .                */                                               
00247    '        w16.1 nw.10 right',                 /* .                */                                               
00248    '        w18.1 nw.8',                        /* .                */                                               
00249    '        w19.1 nw.4',                        /* .                */                                               
00250    '        w21;* nw',                          /* .                */                                               
00251    '| change ~;~~',                             /* Remove thse      */                                               
00252    '| if1: if pick 1.1 == ~.~',                 /* To get these     */                                               
00253    '|   specs ~2~ 1 1;* nw',                    /* ..at the bottom  */                                               
00254    '| if1:',                                    /* Conn 2 if        */                                               
00255    '|   specs ~1~ 1 1;* nw',                    /* Adjust these     */                                               
00256    '| if1:',                                    /* Conn 2 if        */                                               
00257    '| sort 1.1',                                /* Rearrange        */                                               
00258    '| specs w2;* 1',                            /* Remove key       */                                               
00259    '| buffer',                                  /* Prevent stall    */                                               
00260    '| change ~DIR ~FILC~',                      /* Replace this     */                                               
00261    '| if3: if pick 89.1 == ~ ~',                /* If this is empty */                                               
00262    '|      change 89.1 x40 xE1',                /* Replace with..   */                                               
00263    '| if3:',                                    /* Conn 2 if        */                                               
00264    '| if4: if pick anycase substr 1.4 of w2.1 == ~FILC~ or',   /* Select these     */                                
00265    '                       substr 1.4 of w2.1 == ~DIRC~',      /* .                */                                
00266    '|   specs w1.11 1 fs . substr f1 of w-1;-1 nw w13;* nw',   /* Add owner        */                                
00267    '|   specs w1.11 1 fs : substr f2 of w12 nw.8 w13;* nw',    /* Remove fp name   */                                
00268    '| if4:',                                    /* Conn 2 if        */                                               
00269    '| stem input.',                             /* Store as         */                                               
00270    '? p:',                                      /* Conn 2 pick      */                                               
00271    '| specs w3.1 1.3',                          /* Adjust layout    */                                               
00272    '        w1;* nw ',                          /* .                */                                               
00273    '        ~; 2 . . ; 3 . . ;~ n',             /* .                */                                               
00274    '| fi2: faninany',                           /* Take in others   */                                               
00275    '| sort w1.1',                               /* Sort them        */                                               
00276    '| join keylen 3',                           /* Join them        */                                               
00277    '| fi4: faninany',                           /* Take in others   */                                               
00278    '| fi3:',                                    /* Conn 2 faninany  */                                               
00279    '?',                                         /* 2nd pipe         */                                               
00280    'cms QUERY ACCESSED',                        /* Ask cms          */                                               
00281    '| pick substr 1.3 of w-2;-2 == ~DIR~',      /* Keep these       */                                               
00282    '| specs w1.1 1.3',                          /* Adjust layout    */                                               
00283    '        w-1;-1 nw',                         /* .                */                                               
00284    '| fi2:',                                    /* Conn 2 faninany  */                                               
00285    '?',                                         /* 3rd pipe         */                                               
00286    'cp QUERY VIRTUAL DASD',                     /* Ask cp           */                                               
00287    '| specs w2.1 1',                            /* Adjust layout    */                                               
00288    '        ~2~ nw',                            /* .                */                                               
00289    '        w2.2 nw',                           /* .                */                                               
00290    '        w6.1 nw',                           /* .                */                                               
00291    '        w7.1 n',                            /* .                */                                               
00292    '        ~;~ n',                             /* .                */                                               
00293    '| fi1:',                                    /* Conn 2 faninany  */                                               
00294    '?',                                         /* 4th pipe         */                                               
00295    'cp QUERY MDISK 0-FFFF',                     /* Ask CP           */                                               
00296    '| drop first 1',                            /* Remove header    */                                               
00297    '| specs w2.1 1',                            /* Adjust layout    */                                               
00298    '        ~3~ nw',                            /* .                */                                               
00299    '        w3;* nw ',                          /* .                */                                               
00300    '        ~;~n',                              /* .                */                                               
00301    '| fi1:',                                    /* Conn 2 faninany  */                                               
00302    '?',                                         /* 5th pipe         */                                               
00303    'cms LISTDIR .',                             /* Ask cms          */                                               
00304    '| drop first 1',                            /* Remove header    */                                               
00305    '| pick 1.1 == ~-~',                         /* Only non-accessed*/                                               
00306    '| specs w2.1 1',                            /* Remove -         */                                               
00307    '| f2: fanout',                              /* Duplicate recs   */                                               
00308    '| specs ~QUERY DIRATTR~  1 w1.1 nw',        /* Compose cmds     */                                               
00309    '| cms',                                     /* Hand 2 cms       */                                               
00310    '| specs w1.1 1 x40 n',                      /* Add a spaces     */                                               
00311    '| j1: juxtapose',                           /* Join them        */                                               
00312    '| change ~DIRCONTROL~DIRC~',                /* Replace these    */                                               
00313    '| change ~FILECONTROL~FILC~',               /* ...& these       */                                               
00314    '| specs ~.  .~ 1',                          /* Complete layout  */                                               
00315            'w1.1 nw ~. . . . . . . . .; 2 . . ; 3 . . ;~ nw ',  /* .                */                               
00316            'w2.1 nw',                           /* .                */                                               
00317    '| fi4:',                                    /* Conn 2 faninany  */                                               
00318    '? f2:',                                     /* Conn 2 fanout    */                                               
00319    '| j1:'                                      /* Conn 2 juxtapose */                                               
00320 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00321 | Add the nr of blocks per directory                             |                                                   
00322 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00323 Do i=1 To input.0                                                                                                    
00324    If Substr(Word(input.i,2),1,4) = 'FILC' |,                                                                        
00325       Substr(Word(input.i,2),1,4) = 'DIRC' Then Do                                                                   
00326            dir=Reverse(Word(Reverse(input.i),1))                                                                     
00327            Parse Value dir With fpname ':' fspace '.' .                                                              
00328  Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00328 END ?)',                                                                      
00329               'sfsdir 'dir' isodate',            /* Get block        */                                              
00330               '| pick w3.1 \== ~D~',             /* Ignore these     */                                              
00331               '| specs',                         /* Summ blocks      */                                              
00332                       'printonly eof',           /* .                */                                              
00333                       'a: w7.1 .',               /* .                */                                              
00334                       'set #0+=a',               /* .                */                                              
00335                       'eof',                     /* .                */                                              
00336                       'print #0 1',              /* Print total      */                                              
00337               '| var used',                      /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                              
00338               '?',                                    /* 2nd pipe         */                                         
00339               'cms QUERY LIMITS FOR 'fspace fpname,   /* Ask cms          */                                         
00340               '| drop first 1',                       /* Remove hdr       */                                         
00341               '| specs w3.1',                         /* Keep max availabl*/                                         
00342               '| var maxblk'                          /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                         
00343            perc=Format((used/maxblk)*100,2,0)                                                                        
00344            perc=Right(Strip(perc),2,'0')                                                                             
00345            used=used'-'perc                                                                                          
00346            input.i=Subword(input.i,1,6)||Right(Strip(used),14),                                                      
00347                    Right(Word(input.i,7),10),                                                                        
00348                    Right(Word(input.i,8),9),                                                                         
00349                    Right(Word(input.i,9),4),                                                                         
00350                    Right(Word(input.i,11),9),                                                                        
00351                    Left(Word(input.i,12),8),                                                                         
00352                    Right(Word(input.i,13),4),                                                                        
00353                          Word(input.i,14)                                                                            
00354            End                                                                                                       
00355 End i                                                                                                                
00356 Return                                                                                                               
00357                                                                                                                      
00358                                                                                                                      
00359 RunExec:                                                                                                             
00360 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00361 | .                                                              |                                                   
00362 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00363 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00363 END ?)',                                                                                   
00364    'cms EXECMAP 'myfn' XEDIT',             /* Ask CMS          */                                                    
00365    '| drop first 1',                      /* Ignore header    */                                                     
00366    '| count lines',                       /* Count findings   */                                                     
00367    '| if: if pick 1.1 == ~1~',            /* Check this       */                                                     
00368    '|     specs ~EXECDROP 'myfn' XEDIT~ 1', /* Compose cmd    */                                                     
00369    '|     cms',                           /* Issue cmd      */                                                       
00370    '| if:',                               /* Comm 2 if        */                                                     
00371    '| var exldd'                          /* Hand 2 rexx      */                                                     
00372 Address CMS 'EXECLOAD 'myfn' EXEC * = XEDIT'                                                                         
00373 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00374 | Some initial settings and invoke myself as XEDIT macro         |                                                   
00375 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00376 Queue 'SET PREFIX OFF'                                                                                               
00377 Queue 'SET RECFM V'                                                                                                  
00378 Queue 'SET LRECL 500'                                                                                                
00379 Queue 'SET TRUNC *'                                                                                                  
00380 Queue myfn                                                                                                           
00381 Queue ':1'                                                                                                           
00382 Address CMS 'XEDIT 'myfn' OVERVIEW A3 (WIDTH 500'                                                                    
00383 If \exldd Then Address CMS 'EXECDROP 'myfn' XEDIT'                                                                   
00384 Return                                                                                                               
00385                                                                                                                      
00386                                                                                                                      
00387 XeditSettings:                                                                                                       
00388 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00389 | Initial XEDIT settings                                         |                                                   
00390 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00391 'RECFM V'                                                                                                            
00392 'LRECL 500'                                                                                                          
00393 'TRUNC *'                                                                                                            
00394 'VERIFY 1 *'                                                                                                         
00395 'CURLINE ON 4'                                                                                                       
00396 'PREFIX OFF'                                                                                                         
00397 'TOFEOF OFF'                                                                                                         
00398 'SCALE  OFF'                                                                                                         
00399 'EXTRACT /SCREEN'                                                                                                    
00400 'SET ENTER IGNORE'                                                                                                   
00401 lastline=Word(screen.1,2)                       /* This is the last */                                               
00402 maxlines=lastline-6                             /* Max no of lines  */                                               
00403 firstline=5                                     /* First line 2 start*/                                              
00404 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00405 | Define the control char and colors we are going to use...      |                                                   
00406 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00407 'SET CTLCHAR % ESCAPE'                                                                                               
00408 'SET CTLCHAR Y PROTECT   YELLOW HIGH'                                                                                
00409 'SET CTLCHAR y NOPROTECT YELLOW HIGH'                                                                                
00410 'SET CTLCHAR W PROTECT   WHITE  HIGH'                                                                                
00411 'SET CTLCHAR w NOPROTECT WHITE  HIGH'                                                                                
00412 'SET CTLCHAR B PROTECT   BLUE   HIGH'                                                                                
00413 'SET CTLCHAR b NOPROTECT BLUE   HIGH'                                                                                
00414 'SET CTLCHAR G PROTECT   GREEN  HIGH'                                                                                
00415 'SET CTLCHAR g NOPROTECT GREEN  HIGH'                                                                                
00416 'SET CTLCHAR $ OFF'                                                                                                  
00417 Return                                                                                                               
00418                                                                                                                      
00419                                                                                                                      
00420 SetHeader:                                                                                                           
00421 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00422 | Set the header, separator and input line                       |                                                   
00423 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00424 hdr='Label  VDev Mod  Stat   Cyl Blk Files  Blk_Used-(%)   Blk_Left Blk_Total Type R_Blk/Cyl Owner    VDev Directory'
00425 inf='%GLink this: Owner%g________%GVDev%g____%G  or  Directory %g'Copies('_',30)'%G  and%Bpress PF9'                 
00426 Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00426 END ?)',                                                                       
00427     'var hdr',                                                                                                       
