00437 SetPFKeys:                                                                                                           
00438 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00439 | Disable all PF keys and set the ones we need                   |                                                   
00440 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00441 Address CMS 'PIPE (NAME MD.EXEC:00441 END ?)',                                                                       
00442     'var pfk',                                  /* Take this        */                                               
00443     '| split at ,',                             /* Split here       */                                               
00444     '| strip',                                  /* Remove spaces    */                                               
00445     '| specs fs = ~SET PF~ 1 f1 n f2 nw',       /* Compose cmd      */                                               
00446     '| stem setpf.'                             /* Store as         */                                               
00447 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00448 | Reset all PF keys                                              |                                                   
00449 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00450 Do s=1 To 24                                                                                                         
00451    'SET PF's                                                                                                         
00452 End s                                                                                                                
00453 /*---------------------------------------------------------------+                                                   
00454 | Set the new values                                             |                                                   
00455 +---------------------------------------------------------------*/                                                   
00456 Do s=1 To setpf.0                                                                                                    
00457    setpf.s                                                                                                           
00458 End                                                                                                                  
00459 Return                                                                                                               
 
 
